{%- comment -%}
  Lists every collection set up as a school — signalled by having a
  school_primary_color metafield set, not a hardcoded handle list, so a
  second or third school shows up here automatically once its collection
  and metafields exist. See
  docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-15-multi-school-expansion-design.md.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="container">
  <div class="page-content">
    <h1 class="page-content__title">{{ page.title }}</h1>
    {%- if page.content != blank -%}
      <div class="rte page-content__body">{{ page.content }}</div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      An uploaded collection image is the primary visual — a real photo of
      the school reads better as an invitation than a plain color dot. The
      school's color still shows up (the count text, and the card's own
      accent) so it isn't wasted; it just steps back from "the whole card"
      to "an accent" once there's an image, and steps forward to fill the
      media area itself as a fallback for a school that doesn't have one
      uploaded yet — so the grid never has an empty/broken-looking slot.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign school_count = 0 -%}
    <div class="school-cards">
      {%- for cat in collections -%}
        {%- assign school_color = cat.metafields.custom.school_primary_color.value -%}
        {%- unless school_color == blank -%}
          {%- assign school_count = school_count | plus: 1 -%}
          <a href="{{ cat.url }}" class="school-card" style="--school-color: {{ school_color }};">
            <div class="school-card__media">
              {%- if cat.image -%}
                {{ cat.image | image_url: width: 400 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '240,320,400', sizes: '(min-width: 768px) 240px, 45vw', alt: cat.title }}
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
            <div class="school-card__body">
              <span class="school-card__name">{{ cat.title }}</span>
              <span class="school-card__count">
                {{ cat.products_count }} {%- if cat.products_count == 1 -%} design{%- else -%} designs{%- endif -%}
              </span>
            </div>
          </a>
        {%- endunless -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>

    {%- if school_count == 0 -%}
      <p class="school-cards__empty">More schools are on the way — check back soon.</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Find Your School",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
